{"pull": {"id": "number:21705", "number": 21705, "title": "KAFKA-20134: Fix header-based key deserialization in MeteredTimestampedWindowStoreWithHeaders iterator methods", "state": "closed", "draft": false, "created_at": "2026-03-10T21:04:36Z", "closed_at": "2026-03-11T20:32:36Z", "merged_at": "2026-03-11T20:32:36Z", "user": {"login": "frankvicky", "id": 51072200, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjUxMDcyMjAw", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51072200?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky", "html_url": "https://github.com/frankvicky", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "Fixes a bug where `MeteredTimestampedWindowStoreWithHeaders` iterator\nmethods fail when key deserializers require headers.\n\nThe class inherits iterator-returning methods from `MeteredWindowStore`:\n- `fetchAll(long, long)` / `backwardFetchAll(long, long)`    - `all()` /\n`backwardAll()`    - `fetch(K, K, long, long)` / `backwardFetch(K, K,\nlong, long)`\n\nThese methods use the deprecated `serdes::keyFrom(rawKey)` which\nprovides empty headers, causing deserialization failures when headers\nare required.\n\nReviewers: Matthias J. Sax <matthias@confluent.io>\n", "labels": [{"id": 820747028, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw4MjA3NDcwMjg=", "url": "https://api.github.co